       "excerpt": "The website https://nfts2me.network/ is a phishing site impersonating NFTs2Me (https://nfts2me.com), a legitimate NFT collection creation platform. It copies the branding, layout, and design of the official site, specifically replicating the legitimate collection-creation page at https://nfts2me.com/create/edition/. Unlike the real page, when a visitor interacts with elements on nfts2me.network, a \"Connect Wallet\" pop-up appears, listing options such as MetaMask, Trust Wallet, and Phantom. This\u2026",
